body:
### **The RNP resourcepack is now in it's end... And it may not recive more updates...**

# Random NonSense Pack (RNP):
## Nonsense Textures
- Diamond Sword -> Light Saber;
- Crossbow -> Gun;
- Writable Book -> Death Note;
- Totem of undying -> Crussifix (DOORS - Roblox);
- Iron Sword -> Knife;
- Spectral Arrow -> Bullets;
- Netherite Sword -> Real Knife (Undertale);

And More!!!

## Utilities Added in newer versions!
- Ore Outlines;
- Hotbar Numbers;
- Enchanting Table Translations.


### Note: In the 4.2 version (RNP + crowbar), rename a iron pickaxe to "_crowbar_", to obtain a crowbar. In the newer versions, isn't necessary to rename the pickaxe.
